// Count of distinct winning labeled hammings that appear at least twice.
// When none are shared, that count is not a kept one.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hkmany ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hkmany rank

IMPULSE hkmany 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hkmany" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
